{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"御帳親軍","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"漢武帝多行幸之事，置期門、佽飛、羽林之目，天子始有親軍。唐太宗加親、勳、翊、千牛之衛，布腹心之地，防衛密矣。遼太祖宗室盛強，分迭刺部為二，宮衛內虛，經營四方，未遑鳩集。皇后述律氏居守之際，摘蕃漢精銳為屬珊軍；太宗益選天下精甲，置諸爪牙為皮室軍。合騎五十萬，國威壯矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"大帳皮室軍。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"太宗置，凡三十萬騎。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"屬珊軍。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"地皇后置，二十萬騎。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"宮衛騎軍","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"太祖以迭刺部受禪，分本部為五院、六院，統以皇族，而親衛缺然。乃立斡魯朵法，裂州縣，割戶丁，以強幹弱支。詒謀嗣續，世建宮衛。入則居守，出則扈從，葬則因以守陵。有兵事，則五京、二州各提轄司傳檄而集，不待調發州縣、部族，十萬騎軍已立具矣。恩意親洽，兵甲犀利，教練完習。簡天下精銳，聚之腹心之中。懷舊者歲深，增新者世盛。此軍制之良者也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"弘義宮：","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"正丁一萬六千，","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"蕃漢轉丁一萬四千，","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"騎軍六千。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"長寧宮：","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"正丁一萬四千，","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional":"蕃漢轉丁一萬二千，","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_35_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_35","textTraditional"